>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (4.3 Assign Responsibility for Handling Redress)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
355 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (Responsibility for managing redress should be assigned to ensure independence, consistency, and record-keeping. Roles and timelines should be clearly stated, including procedures for internal escalation or referral to regulators where applicable.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
356 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (15)
/Pg 26 0 R
